### Start again and reach it over HTTPS from outside the box
$ [bench@droplet] cd ballast-1.0.0 && bin/ballastctl start
started: https://127.0.0.1:8443 (server pid 305, supervisor pid 304)
certificate SHA-256: 6E:EF:2A:6C:23:04:15:21:C0:EE:3C:99:AF:FC:3E:28:84:35:ED:9C:DC:E0:B3:C1:1F:92:DD:A8:CA:D3:C7:C1
(exit 0)
$ curl -sS --cacert /dev/null -k -o /dev/null -w 'https %{http_code} from host\n' https://172.19.0.5:8443/api/health
